  "notes": [
    "Never mark art accepted to unblock a gate.",
    "All 36 independent painted states and full 20-site native composition were inspected. Foreground dwellings/services are larger than middle sites; the scene uses frontal industrial architecture and quiet separate terrain.",
    "Hall/rampart/guild and seven dwelling chains share sites and upgrade actual equipment/massing. The clipped tier-one scaffold, reagent filtercap and Grail finial were genuinely repainted; guild IV has a genuinely taller central condenser.",
    "Ship uses a standalone repainted barge, avoiding duplicate dock cranes. The final boat placement is in the right canal, clear of the Fighting Pit.",
    "Opaque Citadel candidate is unselected. Its separately generated alpha correction is selected. Capitol receives one whole-atlas crop that removes unused bottom margin and prevents next-row flag contamination; no per-frame fitting.",
    "Five adventure cohorts contain four unique paintings each. Native entrance/ownership and minor geometric/flag/steam continuity still require game and motion review.",
    "Own painted red-X town indicators follow the inspected original built-state convention. No original or other-faction pixels are copied into own assets.",
    "The source cohort is technically prepared, not runtime verified or release accepted. Native clicks/highlights/layer replacement, all legal constructions, UI, capture/save and final visual acceptance remain pending.",
    "The built-in image tool disclosed no model identifier. Source prompts, returned hints and real hashes are preserved; redistribution remains unresolved."
  ],
